00:09:16.122 --> 00:09:18.024
very large housing projects

00:09:18.024 --> 00:09:20.860
where immigrants are

00:09:21.060 --> 00:09:23.062
where many immigrants are located,

00:09:23.062 --> 00:09:25.231
basically mostly manual workers.

00:09:25.665 --> 00:09:28.334
And for the past 40 years, yes,

00:09:28.334 --> 00:09:29.569
there have been major tensions

00:09:29.569 --> 00:09:31.203
between the police

00:09:31.203 --> 00:09:32.872
