00:09:32.872 --> 00:09:35.007
now third generation immigrants.

00:09:35.007 --> 00:09:36.142
And when I'm seeing immigrants, it's

00:09:36.142 --> 00:09:37.410
predominantly from the former

00:09:37.410 --> 00:09:39.211
colonial areas

00:09:39.211 --> 00:09:41.047
of France, meaning North Africa,

00:09:41.047 --> 00:09:43.416
and sub-Saharan Africa.

00:09:43.616 --> 00:09:44.483
And yes, police

00:09:44.483 --> 00:09:46.052
stops are a very big problem in

00:09:46.052 --> 00:09:48.354
France, are a very big bone of contention

00:09:49.255 --> 00:09:51.424
between those youth and the police

00:09:51.424 --> 00:09:53.960
You said there in your report or I think

