it's your report on the ground

00:09:55.127 --> 00:09:55.328
that said,

00:09:55.328 --> 00:09:57.263
there are no statistics in France

00:09:57.263 --> 00:09:58.230
about that. It's true.

00:09:58.230 --> 00:09:59.865
There are no official ones

00:09:59.865 --> 00:10:00.333
but us

00:10:00.333 --> 00:10:02.335
academics have the rights to collect data

00:10:02.335 --> 00:10:02.902
about that

00:10:02.902 --> 00:10:05.304
and to conduct research about that. And.

00:10:05.871 --> 00:10:07.640
Well, depending on the research,

00:10:07.640 --> 00:10:09.542
depending on the on the era,

